### ✅ Rules Table

| Feature | List | Tuple |
|---|---|---|
| Syntax | `[1, 2, 3]` | `(1, 2, 3)` |
| Mutable? | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| Allows duplicates | ✅ | ✅ |
| Ordered | ✅ | ✅ |
| Indexing / slicing | ✅ | ✅ |
| `append()`, `remove()` | ✅ | ❌ |
| Can be dict key | ❌ | ✅ |
| Speed / memory | Slower / more | Faster / less |
| Use when… | data changes | data is fixed |

